From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PickleHik3 <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] meson: options for the features a build can compile out

New options, all true, which is upstream's build: lockscreen, polkit, logind, osk, eds,
calls, bluetooth, location, vpn, hotspot, networkmanager, modemmanager and gudev. A disabled
feature has no dependency, no source files and no plugins in the build, defines
PHOSH_HAVE_<FEATURE> as 0 in phosh-config.h, and takes its objects out of the GtkBuilder files
that name them (tools/tl-ui-filter, between '<!-- tl-if FEATURE -->' markers). The C guards
follow, one commit per feature.

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index 55ac269..8bb8eff 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -134,14 +134,45 @@ i18n = import('i18n')
